(
    title: "Caesars Palace",
    developer: Some("Magnin & Associates"),
    description: Some("You arrive at a casino floor with a line of credit, draw chips from the cashier, then scroll around the room choosing where to gamble: banks of video poker machines, three-reel and four-reel progressive slots, blackjack and roulette tables, and the Big Six money wheel. A pointer places each bet. Cash your chips back in whenever you want to leave."),
